     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div>how can I add a secondry axis with facet_wrap in ggplot</div><div> facet wrap on the years,main y - the mean, secondary <a href=\"http://axis-p.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://axis-p.in&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465872670000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zRH2ztmhwCeuoeeq2yRGy\">axis-p.in</a></div><div><br></div><div>I found some ideas but it didnt work on this...</div><div><br></div><div>I have the attached data frame. and the figure Im generating now. and this is the code I wrote</div><div> </div><div><div>ll&lt;-ggplot(data=df3)+</div><div>geom_point(data=df3,aes(x=Month.Year),y=mean))+geom_line(data=df3,aes(x=(Month.Year),y=mean))+</div><div>  geom_bar(mapping = aes(x =Month.Year , y =<a href=\"http://p.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://p.in&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465872670000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_3xzLRxZ39r_wwrwq6XLR\">p.in</a> ), stat = &quot;identity&quot;) + </div><div>   my_theme+</div><div>xlab(&quot;Date&quot;) + ylab(&quot;above sea level (ft)&quot;)+</div><div>  scale_x_date(date_breaks = &quot;months&quot; , date_labels = &quot;%b&quot;)+facet_wrap(~year,scales=&quot;free_x&quot;)+ </div><div>geom_errorbar(data = df3,aes(x=X1,ymin=mean-sd, ymax=mean+sd))+</div><div>theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 45, hjust = 1))<br></div><div><br></div><div> <br></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>thanks,</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
