   "subject": "Re: [D-RUG]: secondary axis with facet wrap",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Look at facet_grid() if you want another another dimension on another axis for the facets. <br></div><div><br></div><div>If you want another another dimension on the same axis, use + between your variables, i.e. facet_wrap(dim_1 + dim_2~.). You can also combine facet_grid and +, though it might become too much at the end. <br></div><div><br></div><div>Does this answer your question?</div><div></div><div><pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">library</span>(ggplot2)\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#&gt; Registered S3 methods overwritten by &#39;ggplot2&#39;:</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#&gt;   method         from </span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#&gt;   [.quosures     rlang</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#&gt;   c.quosures     rlang</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-style:italic\">#&gt;   print.quosures rlang</span>\r\n\r\nggplot(mpg, aes(displ, hwy)) +\r\n  geom_point() +\r\n  facet_grid(cyl~ drv)\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Wq4W78pDsjEjp_sX3enWmun26ywp7ejCPaw2mfonQi2QsGc317nvd40Th7TGHdLcCTc=s0-d-e1-ft#https://i.imgur.com/5pvsw16.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\">\r\nggplot(mpg, aes(displ, hwy)) +\r\n  geom_point() +\r\n  facet_wrap(cyl+ drv~.)\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><img src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/gS3Sa7Ww-02uYYFJDKwTYTiI20c8htw2ZQvF9kLDIc5PEVNzVwMhTPw-68XUv7E4cTA=s0-d-e1-ft#https://i.imgur.com/vgOOSK3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\">\r\nggplot(mpg, aes(displ, hwy)) +\r\n  geom_point() +\r\n  facet_grid(cyl +fl~ drv)\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/WZHTRoTFvu5SVvKW0BxBs3sD1W7eDQNNvXKN8bUEMyg2fS6keu1SVEij8wJLvU7xJoQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://i.imgur.com/hCOrqx8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5gYGAgcjxicj5saWJyYXJ5KGdncGxvdDIpPGJyPiMmZ3Q7IFJl\r\nZ2lzdGVyZWQgUzMgbWV0aG9